WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.000
With Kubernetes running, PostgreSQL is chosen in the database panel.

2
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Deploy asks for confirmation before it changes anything.

3
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:40.000
The deployment checks its prerequisites, then installs the CloudNativePG operator.

4
00:00:40.000 --> 00:01:40.000
The Kubernetes Monitor shows the operator start, then the PostgreSQL instances being created.

5
00:01:40.000 --> 00:03:04.000
CloudNativePG builds a three-instance cluster: one primary and two replicas, each in its own pod.

6
00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:15.000
PostgreSQL is deployed in 2 minutes 45 seconds.

7
00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:53.000
A final validation confirms all three instances are healthy. PostgreSQL platform validation: PASS.

